# Build output. Regenerated by `npm run build`; never edited by hand.
#
# Deliberately NOT committed. It is 20 MB of generated files, 19 MB of which is
# a verbatim copy of public/mediapipe and public/models, and committing it means
# every source change produces a second, larger, redundant diff that can drift
# out of step with the source it came from.
dist/

node_modules/

# Semgrep / scanner output, written into the working directory by default.
sg*.json
*.sarif

# Chrome Web Store upload artefacts.
*.zip
*.crx
*.pem

npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
